name: GitHub Token
icon: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/github-token/icon.svg
version: 1.0.1
creator: Mohtadi Azad Mahi
description: Enter a GitHub token once and every GitHub API request in the editor — including ones made by other add-ons — is sent through it automatically. Shows live requests-remaining, reset countdown, per-source counts and a recent-request log. Matches by host, so new GitHub calls are picked up with no updates.
p/html: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/github-token/github-token.html
p/css: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/github-token/github-token.css
p/js: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/github-token/github-token.js
